# A stage0 sample of every comparison, logic, and arithmetic target at its
# boundaries: each Int64 and Byte comparison on a smaller, an equal, and a
# larger operand, the truth tables of and, or, xor, and not, and division and
# remainder with negative operands. A C operator written wrong (`<=` for `<`)
# changes a line of its output, which the built executable must print as
# `refined run` does. It exits with code 0.
boundaries is module
boundaries purpose "Print comparisons, logic, and arithmetic at their boundaries"
boundaries path boundaries
boundaries imports standard.console
boundaries imports standard.compare
boundaries imports standard.logic
boundaries imports standard.math
boundaries exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout none

flag is operation
flag purpose "Print a label and a Bool as 0 or 1 on one line"
flag invariant none
flag typeParameter none
flag input label String borrowed
flag input value Bool copied
flag output none
flag outputOwnedBy none
flag raises none
flag effect write console.stdout
flag uses stdoutWriter
flag memoryHeap false
flag async false
flag maxRecursion none
flag label begin loopKind none
flag label begin within none
flag label writeLabelDone loopKind none
flag label writeLabelDone within none
flag label yes loopKind none
flag label yes within none
flag label writeOneDone loopKind none
flag label writeOneDone within none
flag label no loopKind none
flag label no within none
flag label writeZeroDone loopKind none
flag label writeZeroDone within none
flag let oneText String "1" immutable
flag let zeroText String "0" immutable
flag at begin do writeLabel
flag at begin branch ifError writeLabel goto writeLabelDone else goto writeLabelDone
flag at writeLabelDone branch if value goto yes else goto no
flag at yes do writeOne
flag at yes branch ifError writeOne goto writeOneDone else goto writeOneDone
flag at writeOneDone return ok none
flag at no do writeZero
flag at no branch ifError writeZero goto writeZeroDone else goto writeZeroDone
flag at writeZeroDone return ok none

